{"id":"n80035-1-9","stage":2,"title":"집세 · 房租","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80035-1-9-1","ko":"사정상 집세를 올려야 할 것 같아.","zh":"因为一些特殊情况，看来我得提高房租了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사정상","meaning":"处境，情况，原因，缘由","explanation":"사정：处境，情况，原因，缘由；상：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"사정","audio":"/audio/2389c7672871f28155a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15669","senseId":"1","lemma":"사정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사정상","audio":"/audio/9e4ab3f06f4922c1905a.mp3"}},{"text":"집세를","meaning":"房租","explanation":"집세：房租；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"집세","audio":"/audio/d4d231cab576236f3406.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80035","senseId":"1","lemma":"집세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집세를","audio":"/audio/d0f931378582a33a8e9a.mp3"}},{"text":"올려야","meaning":"提高，抬高","explanation":"올리다：提高，抬高；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"올리다","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22109","senseId":"1","lemma":"올리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올려야","audio":"/audio/6e8d4f7218dba9531d9d.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","au